{% layout 'pond' %}
<h1 class="pp-title" data-stitch="{{ page.title | downcase | escape }}" data-size="96">{{ page.title }}</h1>
<article class="pp-card pp-rte">
  {{ page.content }}
  <details class="pp-q" open><summary>How long will my order take?</summary><p>Most items are made to order, so please allow extra time for creation and shipping. This is a one-woman operation, so I really appreciate your patience!</p></details>
  <details class="pp-q"><summary>Do you accept custom orders or commissions?</summary><p>Yes! I'd absolutely love to bring your vision to life. Whether you have a specific idea, an event, or just a vibe, please reach out at <a href="mailto:studiopinkplume@gmail.com">studiopinkplume@gmail.com</a>. I insist! (But also no pressure - you do you!)</p></details>
  <details class="pp-q"><summary>What is the return policy?</summary><p>There is a 14-day return policy from the date you receive your item. To be eligible for a return, items must be unworn, unused, and in their original condition and packaging. You'll need your receipt or proof of purchase, and you're responsible for return shipping costs. Please note: custom/personalized items and ear jewelry cannot be returned for hygiene reasons. You can find the full return policy <a href="/policies/refund-policy">here</a>.</p></details>
  <details class="pp-q"><summary>What if my item arrives damaged?</summary><p>Please inspect your order as soon as it arrives! If something is defective, damaged, or wrong, contact us immediately at <a href="mailto:studiopinkplume@gmail.com">studiopinkplume@gmail.com</a> so we can make it right.</p></details>
</article>
